摘要（便于快速判断，不改变上文效力）
------------------------------------------------------------
CCZJ Video is provided "as is", free of charge, for personal,
non-commercial use only. Redistribution of unmodified copies to
individuals without charge is allowed; commercial use, paid
distribution, reselling, repackaging under another name and removal
of attribution are not allowed without written permission from the
